SpargeAttn
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright (c) 2025 SpargeAttn team. All rights reserved.
License: Apache-2.0
Website: https://github.com/thu-ml/SpargeAttn (pinned: ae5b629, see
third_party/sparge/VENDOR.md)

The block_sparse_sage2_attn plugin implements the equivalent of SpargeAttn's
block_sparse_sage2_attn_cuda (sm89 path). Extracted minimum (no whole-repo
vendoring, no pybind/torch): csrc/{cp_async,mma,permuted_smem,math,
reduction_utils,numeric_conversion}.cuh and
csrc/qattn/{qk_int_sv_f8_cuda_sm89.cuh,attn_utils.cuh,decl.cuh} are unmodified
copies; upstream's 192 autogen instantiations are replaced by 4 explicit ones
(src/kernel/sparge/sparge_sm89_inst.cu); the Triton/Python pre-steps are
rewritten torch-free (src/kernel/sparge/sparge_pre.cu). SpargeAttn descends
from SageAttention (see above). The plugin is registered under this project's
own "dit-plugins" TRT namespace.

